cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this calculator, its documentation or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Drake Equation Calculator"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, bilingual Drake Equation calculator with a documented
  scientific registry: every parameter carries a source, a date and a status
  (observed, derived or assumption), and the published methodology page is
  generated from that registry.
type: software
